    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I’ve always found math fascinating, especially its patterns and logic. As a former chemistry student, I enjoy solving problems and seeing how concepts connect. My hobbies like hiking and gardening help me think creatively, which complements my analytical approach to math. I see it as a tool for understanding the world, not just numbers.",
